SUMMARY:112th UC Davis Picnic Day
DESCRIPTION:The 112th UC Davis Picnic Day will take place on Saturday\, April 18\, 2026. As one of the largest student-run events in the nation\, this year’s theme is “The Journey Home: Destination Davis” and features over 200 activities including the parade\, Doxie Derby\, and more.  \n\n\nKey details for the 2026 event:\n\nNumber: 112th Annual Picnic Day.\nDate: Saturday\, April 18\, 2026.\nTheme: “The Journey Home: Destination Davis”.\nHighlights: Parade\, Battle of the Bands\, Fashion Show\, and Wiener Dog Races \n\n 
