SUMMARY:Healthy Aging Forum 2026
DESCRIPTION:UC Davis OLLI and UC Davis Health Mini Medical School are proud to partner to present the 2026 Healthy Aging Forum at Aggie Square. This forum features UC Davis faculty presenting on the US POINTER study\, a clinical trial demonstrating how lifestyle programs can improve cognition in older adults. Additional presentations will explore how meaning and purpose support overall well-being\, and the role of mobility and exercise in longevity. This is a FREE event with limited seating. Complimentary bus transportation from OLLI to Aggie Square and back is available to the first 44 registrants. Register via UC Davis OLLI at https://ucdavis.co1.qualtrics.com/jfe/form/SV_3V4UzjRysTXFBiu. \n 
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/healthy-aging-forum-2026/
LOCATION:UC Davis Aggie Square\, 2800 49th Street\, Sacramento\, CA\, 95817\, United States
CATEGORIES:Community
END:VEVENT
