SUMMARY:Earth's Greatest Enemy: Free Film Screening
DESCRIPTION:Join the group Woodland for Peace (W4P) for a nicely themed Earth Day film. A documentary exposé of the world’s biggest–and most unaccountable–polluter: the US military. Learn the environmental cost of having a military Empire with director Abby Martin. Abby Martin also made the film Gaza Fights for Freedom. This event will include a virtual Q&A with director Abby Martin after the film \nThere will be free light snacks and refreshments! \n 
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/earths-greatest-enemy-free-film-screening/
LOCATION:American Lutheran Church\, 1114 College St\, Woodland\, CA 95695\, 1114 College St\, Woodland\, CA\, 95695
