SUMMARY:UC Davis Picnic Day Farm-to-Fork Dinner
DESCRIPTION:🌿🍷 Farm-to-Fork Dinner at Great Bear Vineyards — UC Davis Picnic Day 🍷🌿\nSaturday\, April 18 | 5:00–8:00 pm\n📍 Just 3 miles from downtown Davis \nAfter a full day of fun\, traditions\, and high-energy excitement at UC Davis Picnic Day\, slip away from the crowds and wind down in the vineyard. Join us at Great Bear Vineyards for a relaxed Farm-to-Fork Dinner with live music\, set among our organic vines and glowing in the golden light of sunset.\nWhether you’re an Aggie alum\, a current student\, or a local looking to end the day on a high note\, this is your invitation to sip\, savor\, and celebrate spring with great food\, great wine\, and even better company. \n🍽 Spring Farm-to-Fork Dinner Menu\nA chef-prepared feast highlighting fresh\, locally sourced ingredients:\n• Mixed greens salad with seasonal local produce\n• Creamy mashed potatoes with sweet corn\n• Seasonal roasted vegetables\n• Grilled tri-tip with smoky BBQ sauce & creamed horseradish\n• Italian herb chicken topped with fresh tomato bruschetta\n• Mediterranean succotash with chickpeas\, beans & garden vegetables\n• Bite-sized desserts for a sweet finish \n🍷 Wine Available for Purchase:\n• Glass of wine — $10\n• Bottles of Chardonnay\, Rosé\, or Red Blend — $38 \nSettle in with live music\, a cozy vineyard atmosphere\, and the perfect chance to slow things down after the bustle of Picnic Day. This is what spring evenings in Davis are all about. \n✨ Great food. Great wine. Great vibes. \n🐴 Go Aggies!
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/uc-davis-picnic-day-farm-to-fork-dinner/
LOCATION:Great Bear Vineyards (Great Bear)\, 24800 County Rd 101A
CATEGORIES:Community,Food & Drink
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/4-18-26-Thumbnail.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Great Bear Vineyards":MAILTO:greatbearvineyards@gmail.com
GEO:38.5818013;-121.7499687
