SUMMARY:Stand-up Comedy with Lexis Sharde and Joe Hill
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for a stacked night of comedy made for students who like their laughs smart\, bold\, and highly relatable. This BYOB comedy event features two nationally touring comedians\, each delivering extended 45-minute sets\, plus a dynamic host to keep the energy high all night. 18 and older only. \nJoe Hill opens the double feature with a full 45-minute set. A Bronx-born comedian\, writer\, and actor\, Joe has performed in over 40 states and built a strong national following for his sharp storytelling and feel-good comedy. His style draws inspiration from legends like Sinbad\, Red Foxx\, and Martin Lawrence\, blending observational humor with big laughs and heart. Joe has appeared on Comedy Central\, Netflix\, FOX\, SiriusXM\, and more\, and his stand-up special You Take Care has surpassed 100K views on YouTube. \nFollowing Joe is Lexis Shardé\, delivering her own 45-minute set that blends stand-up\, storytelling\, musical comedy\, and dry takes on modern life. A comedian and filmmaker with over a decade of experience\, Lexis has appeared on CBS alongside Iliza Shlesinger and trained at Upright Citizens Brigade in Los Angeles. Her comedy pulls from dating\, work\, pop culture\, and everyday chaos\, all filtered through a sharp millennial lens that college audiences connect with instantly. \nHosting the night is Danielle Arce\, a seasoned stand-up known for her unapologetic humor and confident stage presence. With performances across the U.S.\, internationally\, and even for the U.S. Military overseas\, Danielle keeps the show fast-paced\, fun\, and flowing from start to finish. \n-Two full comedy sets\n-BYOB\n-College-friendly vibes\n-Zero midterms\, all laughs \nBring your friends\, bring your drinks\, and catch a comedy night that feels more like a hang than a show. \n 
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/stand-up-comedy-with-lexis-sharde-and-joe-hill/
LOCATION:Melon Ball – Watermelon Music\, 1970 Lake Blvd\, Suite #1\, Davis\, California\, 95616\, United States
CATEGORIES:Community
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Lexis.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Watermelon Music":MAILTO:watermelonmusicdavis@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR